  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05  WS-ESQL-FL-END-THREAD    PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05  WS-ESQL-FL-ABORT         PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05  WS-ESQL-SQLCODE          PIC S9(9) BINARY.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05  WS-ESQL-RDMCA.
